    17	 *    localStorage. Every backend call lives in `playwrightService.ts` and lands
    18	 *    here as a plain mutation.
    19	 * 2. **No `$effect`.** `$effect` is illegal in a `.svelte.ts` module. Loading is
    20	 *    driven imperatively by the service.
