    16	 *     and `detail` fields are ADDITIVE — a desktop build older than they are
    17	 *     simply will not send them, and a browser tab has no desktop app behind it
    18	 *     at all. Both cases must produce no chip rather than a guess, so every
    19	 *     read here is defensive and returns null when it is not certain.
    20	 *
    21	 *  2. Hold back the extra lookups while the server is still getting started.
